Place the Stockfish executable here, named for the build target:

  stockfish-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.exe     Windows
  stockfish-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu       Linux
  stockfish-aarch64-apple-darwin           macOS (Apple silicon)

Tauri's externalBin requires the target-triple suffix here, and strips it when
bundling, so the installed app receives plain `stockfish.exe`. Both names are
searched at runtime.

See the README for which CPU build to pick.
